S 15 发布前后，我们共邀请 6 万多名用户参与版本内测，举行 9 场线下共创营活动深度交流，共产出 2 万多条产品反馈，共同推动了 ColorOS 15 使用体验的完善与提升。\nColorOS\nColorOS 共创者星球\n年度盛典\nColorOS 在 2021 年收到近十万条有效反馈，累计千余篇优质内容产出，并于年底邀请部分共创者参加 “聚心力，迸新意” 2021 共创者星球年度盛典，共同见证、并感谢共创者的力量。\nColorOS 共创者星球上线\nColorOS 共创者星球 —— 为 ColorOS 共创者提供的产品共创交流平台，自 2020 年创立至今已有 20773 位共创者入驻并长期参与共创活动。\n\n\n========\n搜索关键词：OPPO ColorOS Agent AI\n\n网页标题：OPPO 发布“新计算、新感知、新生态”全新 AI 战略布局 | OPPO 官方网站\n\n网页链接：https://www.oppo.com/cn/newsroom/press/539/\n\n发布时间：2025-10-15T00:00:00+08:00\n\n网页内容：OPPO 发布“新计算、新感知、新生态”全新 AI 战略布局\n新闻报道 · 2025 年 10 月 15 日\n\n![](https://www.oppo.com/content/dam/oppo_com/cn/mkt/newsroom/press/2025/10/539/cover-header.webp)\n10 月 15 日，2025OPPO 开发者大会（ODC25）在深圳开幕，大会发布了全新 ColorOS 16，并发布 OPPO AI 的“新计算、新感知、新生态”全新战略布局。\n今年，全新 ColorOS 16 对于流畅的探索更进一步，带来全新流畅技术架构。其中，全新极光引擎带来安卓首个无缝架构，通过重塑传统安卓模块化架构，将不同业务模块进行一体化无缝绘制和分布式响应调度，实现全场景的丝滑流畅。针对极限重载场景，全面升级的潮汐引擎带来行业首发芯片级动态追帧技术，实现了软硬协同的系统级动画性能优化，让系统重载流畅度提升 37%，功耗降低了 13%。\n\n![](https://www.oppo.com/content/dam/oppo_com/cn/mkt/newsroom/press/2025/10/539/1.webp)\n在此次开发者大会上，OPPO AI 的全新战略也正式公布，即“新计算、新感知、新生态”，以 On-Device Compute 端侧智能计算、PersonaX 记忆共生引擎，以及 Agent Matrix 智能体生态框架三大技术底座，OPPO AI 将打造与用户共生的智慧系统。\n据了解，On-Device Compute 是端侧智能计算的技术底座，通过高密度端侧模型和高性能推理框架，成功突破多模态大模型在移动终端上的应用难题，推理性能峰值能达 300tokens/s、128k 最长上下文，将端侧智能计算留在掌心，让时刻在线的 AI 更安全。PersonaX 作为一个以用户为中心的多模态记忆引擎，依托泛在感知系统，实现对用户全时、全域、全维度行为的深度感知和理解，进而构建起终身记忆驱动的“懂你 AI”核心能力。Agent Matrix 智能体生态框架，是智能体跨设备协同的核心平台，也是 AI 智能体实现从单步执行升级到复杂任务规划与多设备联动的关键突破，能够为用户带来无缝、高效、智能化的全新交互体验。\n\n![](https://www.oppo.com/content/dam/oppo_com/cn/mkt/newsroom/press/2025/10/539/2.webp)\n在此次大会上，OPPO 也正式发布“OPPO 隐私安全智护体系”，通过全新升级的权限管理，实现用户隐私的透明可控，同时推出了一系列合作策略，持续为开发者提供从技术支撑到规模增长的全链路解决方案，助力开发者在安全合规基础上实现高效增长。\n聚焦生态构建方面，OPPO 不仅致力于提升用户隐私安全水平，更通过覆盖应用全生命周期的支持系统，帮助开发者应对从本土创新到全球运营的挑战，实现长期发展。为此，平台打破原有限制，向个人开发者开放应用上传权限，让独立开发者的创意也能获得正式分发机会，享受与企业同等的成长支持，为应用生态注入源源不断的创新动力，相关能力将于 2025 年 12 月底正式对外开放。\n\n![](https://www.oppo.com/content/dam/oppo_com/cn/mkt/newsroom/press/2025/10/539/3.webp)\n此外，OPPO 开放平台为全球开发者提供更方便的海外增长通道，支持“一键出海”，帮助开发者将应用直达 OPPO 应用服务所覆盖的 108 个国家或地区，无需重复打包或多次上传，真正实现“开发一次，全球发布”。\nOPPO 发布“新计算、新感知、新生态”全新 AI 战略布局\n10 月 15 日，2025OPPO 开发者大会（ODC25）在深圳开幕，大会发布了全新 ColorOS 16，并发布 OPPO AI 的“新计算、新感知、新生态”全新战略布局。\n今年，全新 ColorOS 16 对于流畅的探索更进一步，带来全新流畅技术架构。其中，全新极光引擎带来安卓首个无缝架构，通过重塑传统安卓模块化架构，将不同业务模块进行一体化无缝绘制和分布式响应调度，实现全场景的丝滑流畅。针对极限重载场景，全面升级的潮汐引擎带来行业首发芯片级动态追帧技术，实现了软硬协同的系统级动画性能优化，让系统重载流畅度提升 37%，功耗降低了 13%。\n在此次开发者大会上，OPPO AI 的全新战略也正式公布，即“新计算、新感知、新生态”，以 On-Device Compute 端侧智能计算、PersonaX 记忆共生引擎，以及 Agent Matrix 智能体生态框架三大技术底座，OPPO AI 将打造与用户共生的智慧系统。\n据了解，On-Device Compute 是端侧智能计算的技术底座，通过高密度端侧模型和高性能推理框架，成功突破多模态大模型在移动终端上的应用难题，推理性能峰值能达 300tokens/s、128k 最长上下文，将端侧智能计算留在掌心，让时刻在线的 AI 更安全。PersonaX 作为一个以用户为中心的多模态记忆引擎，依托泛在感知系统，实现对用户全时、全域、全维度行为的深度感知和理解，进而构建起终身记忆驱动的“懂你 AI”核心能力。Agent Matrix 智能体生态框架，是智能体跨设备协同的核心平台，也是 AI 智能体实现从单步执行升级到复杂任务规划与多设备联动的关键突破，能够为用户带来无缝、高效、智能化的全新交互体验。\n在此次大会上，OPPO 也正式发布“OPPO 隐私安全智护体系”，通过全新升级的权限管理，实现用户隐私的透明可控，同时推出了一系列合作策略，持续为开发者提供从技术支撑到规模增长的全链路解决方案，助力开发者在安全合规基础上实现高效增长。\n聚焦生态构建方面，OPPO 不仅致力于提升用户隐私安全水平，更通过覆盖应用全生命周期的支持系统，帮助开发者应对从本土创新到全球运营的挑战，实现长期发展。为此，平台打破原有限制，向个人开发者开放应用上传权限，让独立开发者的创意也能获得正式分发机会，享受与企业同等的成长支持，为应用生态注入源源不断的创新动力，相关能力将于 2025 年 12 月底正式对外开放。\n此外，OPPO 开放平台为全球开发者提供更方便的海外增长通道，支持“一键出海”，帮助开发者将应用直达 OPPO 应用服务所覆盖的 108 个国家或地区，无需重复打包或多次上传，真正实现“开发一次，全球发布”。\n\n\n--------\n搜索关键词：OPPO ColorOS Agent AI\n\n网页标题：OPPO and Google Deepen AI Partnership with ColorOS 16 and the Upcoming Find X9 Series\n\n网页链接：https://us.smartprix.com/bytes/oppo-and-google-deepen-ai-partnership-with-coloros-16-and-the-upcoming-find-x9-series/\n\n发布时间：2025-10-28T00:00:00+08:00\n\n网页内容：News\nOPPO and Google Deepen AI Partnership with ColorOS 16 and the Upcoming Find X9 Series\nBy Mehtab Ansari • Updated On Oct 28, 2025TL; DR\nOPPO and Google collaborate to bring “personalized” and “secure” mobile AI to ColorOS 16 and the Find X9 Series.\nAI Mind Space has now been integrated with Gemini to let users combine the power of both to get more personalized results.\nOPPO claims that their features run via their own AI Private Computing Cloud with encrypted Google Cloud processing.\nThe Mind Space feature will also be rolling out to other OPPO devices via the ColorOS 16 update.\nOPPO has announced a deeper partnership with Google to improve personalized and secure AI experiences on its phones. The collaboration brings Google’s Gemini AI into OPPO’s ecosystem, particularly within the new Mind Space feature, set to debut with the upcoming Find X9 Series and ColorOS 16.\nAt the core of this initiative is AI Mind Space, a new OPPO app designed to help users capture and organize on-screen content. With a three-finger swipe or the Snap Key, users can save text, images, or web pages into one place, where AI then categorizes and summarizes the information automatically.\n![](https://i0.wp.com/www.smartprix.com/bytes/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/InCollage_20251027_111729967-scaled.jpg?ssl=1\u0026quality=80\u0026w=728\u0026h=546)\nAnd with the Gemini integration, users can act on that saved Mind Space data, like asking it to generate a custom itinerary or manage stored notes, while maintaining full permission control. This makes the feature even more helpful.\n![](https://i0.wp.com/www.smartprix.com/bytes/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/image-114.png?ssl=1\u0026quality=80\u0026w=728\u0026h=452)\nThe partnership also includes Gemini Live, which offers real-time visual assistance. Users can share their camera view or screen and get interactive overlays for guidance, like for troubleshooting a device or organizing workspace items. Another integrated feature is Nano Banana which allows for precise AI image editing through simple prompts.\nPrivacy remains central to OPPO’s AI strategy. OPPO says that all the sensitive processing runs through the OPPO AI Private Computing Cloud, powered by Google Cloud’s confidential computing, ensuring encrypted, private data handling that’s inaccessible even to OPPO.\n![](https://i0.wp.com/www.smartprix.com/bytes/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/image-117.png?ssl=1\u0026quality=80\u0026w=728\u0026h=487)\nTools such as AI Mind Space, AI Search, AI Recorder, AI Writer, and AI Call Summary all function within this secure environment.\nBuyers of the OPPO Find X9 or OPPO Find X9 Pro will receive a three-month Google AI Pro subscription, including 2 TB cloud storage and access to the latest Gemini features. The Mind Space feature will also roll out to other compatible devices via the ColorOS 16 update.\n![](https://i0.wp.com/www.smartprix.com/bytes/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Preferred-Source.png?ssl=1\u0026quality=80\u0026w=728\u0026h=94)\n\n--------\n搜索关键词：OPPO ColorOS Agent AI\n\n网页标题：What is ColorOS 15's Gemini App Feature | OPPO Global\n\n网页链接：https://support.oppo.com/en/answer/?aid=2202799\n\n网页内容：What is ColorOS 15's Gemini App Feature\nApplicable products： Smartphones\nSystem version： ColorOS 15.X，ColorOS 15 and above，ColorOS 15\nThe Gemini App, powered by Google’s Gemini large language model, is an innovative smart conversation application integrated into ColorOS 15. Designed to enhance your daily interactions and provide a seamless AI-driven experience, Gemini combines natural and fluent conversations with powerful tools for learning, creation, and integration with Google services.\nGemini App in ColorOS 15: Your Smart Conversation Companion\nGemini brings unparalleled conversational capabilities to ColorOS 15, making it a versatile tool for various scenarios:\nQ\u0026A Support: Ask Gemini about anything, from daily queries to specialized professional knowledge, and receive detailed answers.\nCreative Assistance: Need help drafting emails, writing articles, composing poems, or brainstorming ideas? Gemini is your go-to assistant.\nReal-Time Translation: Break language barriers with its multi-language real-time translation feature.\nLearning Resource: Consult Gemini on diverse topics, and it will explain concepts like an expert tutor.\nIntegration with Google Services\nGemini leverages Google’s ecosystem to provide seamless support for widely-used services:\nGmail: Compose and reply to emails with Gemini’s assistance, saving time and improving communication.\nGoogle Maps: Plan trips, get directions, and explore new places effortlessly by interacting with Gemini.\nYouTube: Discover new videos and personalized recommendations through Gemini’s intelligent search capabilities.\nMultimodal Interaction\nInteracting with Gemini is effortless, thanks to its multimodal support:\nText-Based Conversations: Engage in conversations by typing your queries.\nVoice Interaction: Communicate naturally using voice input for added convenience.\nImage Analysis: Show Gemini pictures for descriptions or analytical insights, making it an excellent tool for visual tasks.\nNote: Whether you’re managing your daily schedule, seeking entertainment, or learning something new, Gemini serves as a powerful assistant. Its capabilities extend beyond casual conversations, providing practical tools for professional and personal growth.\nWith its seamless integration into ColorOS 15, Gemini App elevates your smartphone experience by blending AI innovation with practical utility, making it a must-have feature for OPPO users.\n\n\n--------\n搜索关键词：OPPO ColorOS Agent AI\n\n网页标题：OPPO Redefines Personalized Mobile AI Experiences with Google | OPPO Global\n\n网页链接：https://www.oppo.com/en/newsroom/press/oppo-find-x9-series-coloros-16-google-gemini/\n\n发布时间：2025-10-25T00:00:00+08:00\n\n网页内容：SPAIN, 25th October–OPPO, a leading global smart device brand, today announced a deeper collaboration with Google to redefine personalized and secure mobile AI, focusing on personalized AI capabilities, AI model deployment, and AI privacy. Through this technical cooperation, OPPO aims to deliver more intuitive, secure, and comprehensive mobile AI experiences to users worldwide.\n\"Working closely with partners like Google allows us to integrate next-generation AI experiences that are not only powerful but also highly personalized and secure,\" said Kai Tang, President of Software Engineering at OPPO. \"Our goal is to provide users with an AI assistant that both truly understands their personal needs and is also worthy of being entrusted with their personal data.\"\nTake action with Mind Space in Gemini\nCentral to this collaboration is our app Mind Space available on the upcoming Find X9 Series, designed to help users capture and organize information more intuitively.\nWith a simple three-finger swipe, content currently on screen—whether text, images, or web pages—can be saved directly into a unified hub. Mind Space automatically categorizes saved content, providing a single, organized location for users' ideas and information.\nTo unlock its full potential, OPPO has partnered with Google to connect the app Mind Space with Gemini. This allows Gemini to now pull information and help users take action with content from Mind Space. And you stay in control at all times by choosing what Gemini can see and pull from within Mind Space. For example, a user planning a trip can save articles and notes to their Mind Space, then ask Gemini to create a detailed itinerary using the content that has been saved.\nGoogle Gemini on OPPO Find X9 Series\nIn addition to Mind Space in Gemini, users can also chat with Gemini to connect to other OPPO applications, share what's on their screen or camera for help, or edit photos with Gemini's new image editing model Nano Banana.\nWith Gemini Live, users can ask about anything they see. They can share their phone's camera or screen for assistance with storage ideas or step-by-step guidance for fixing their coffee machine. Rolling out now, Gemini can provide visual guidance by highlighting elements directly on your screen, creating a new way to learn and solve problems together.\nWhen editing images, users can use Gemini to get access to Nano Banana-Gemini's new image editing model. Nano Banana allows users to enhance their photos with creative edits using a simple prompt on generated or uploaded images.\nA Foundation Built on Privacy and Trust\nAs AI becomes more integrated into daily life, OPPO and Google have engineered a solution with user privacy as a core principle. The collaboration utilizes the OPPO AI Private Computing Cloud (PCC), which leverages Google Cloud's confidential computing services.\nThis architecture ensures that sensitive data for AI processing is handled in a secure and encrypted environment, making it inaccessible to any third party, including OPPO. Key features such as AI Mind Space, AI Search, AI Call Summary, AI VoiceScribe, AI Recorder, and AI Writer all operate within this secure framework, allowing users to leverage intelligent services with the confidence that their personal data remains private.\nLaunching on OPPO Find X9 Series\nThe full suite of these advanced AI features will debut on the upcoming OPPO Find X9 Series and ColorOS 16 on OPPO flagship devices. Purchasers of Find X9 or Find X9 Pro will receive a complimentary three-month subscription to Google AI Pro, which includes higher access to new and powerful features in Gemini and 2TB of cloud storage.\nOPPO Redefines Personalized Mobile AI Experiences with Google\nSPAIN, 25th October–OPPO, a leading global smart device brand, today announced a deeper collaboration with Google to redefine personalized and secure mobile AI, focusing on personalized AI capabilities, AI model deployment, and AI privacy. Through this technical cooperation, OPPO aims to deliver more intuitive, secure, and comprehensive mobile AI experiences to users worldwide.\n\"Working closely with partners like Google allows us to integrate next-generation AI experiences that are not only powerful but also highly personalized and secure,\" said Kai Tang, President of Software Engineering at OPPO. \"Our goal is to provide users with an AI assistant that both truly understands their personal needs and is also worthy of being entrusted with their personal data.\"\nTake action with Mind Space in Gemini\nCentral to this collaboration is our app Mind Space available on the upcoming Find X9 Series, designed to help users capture and organize information more intuitively.\nWith a simple three-finger swipe, content currently on screen—whether text, images, or web pages—can be saved directly into a unified hub. Mind Space automatically categorizes saved content, providing a single, organized location for users' ideas and information.\nTo unlock its full potential, OPPO has partnered with Google to connect the app Mind Space with Gemini. This allows Gemini to now pull information and help users take action with content from Mind Space. And you stay in control at all times by choosing what Gemini can see and pull from within Mind Space. For example, a user planning a trip can save articles and notes to their Mind Space, then ask Gemini to create a detailed itinerary using the content that has been saved.\nGoogle Gemini on OPPO Find X9 Series\nIn addition to Mind Space in Gemini, users can also chat with Gemini to connect to other OPPO applications, share what's on their screen or camera for help, or edit photos with Gemini's new image editing model Nano Banana.\nWith Gemini Live, users can ask about anything they see. They can share their phone's camera or screen for assistance with storage ideas or step-by-step guidance for fixing their coffee machine. Rolling out now, Gemini can provide visual guidance by highlighting elements directly on your screen, creating a new way to learn and solve problems together.\nWhen editing images, users can use Gemini to get access to Nano Banana-Gemini's new image editing model. Nano Banana allows users to enhance their photos with creative edits using a simple prompt on generated or uploaded images.\nA Foundation Built on Privacy and Trust\nAs AI becomes more integrated into daily life, OPPO and Google have engineered a solution with user privacy as a core principle. The collaboration utilizes the OPPO AI Private Computing Cloud (PCC), which leverages Google Cloud's confidential computing services.\nThis architecture ensures that sensitive data for AI processing is handled in a secure and encrypted environment, making it inaccessible to any third party, including OPPO. Key features such as AI Mind Space, AI Search, AI Call Summary, AI VoiceScribe, AI Recorder, and AI Writer all operate within this secure framework, allowing users to leverage intelligent services with the confidence that their personal data remains private.\nLaunching on OPPO Find X9 Series\nThe full suite of these advanced AI features will debut on the upcoming OPPO Find X9 Series and ColorOS 16 on OPPO flagship devices. Purchasers of Find X9 or Find X9 Pro will receive a complimentary three-month subscription to Google AI Pro, which includes higher access to new and powerful features in Gemini and 2TB of cloud storage.\n Gemini and Nano Banana are trademarks of Google LLC. Check responses. Setup required. Compatibility and availability vary. 1...\n\n\n--------\n搜索关键词：OPPO ColorOS Agent AI\n\n网页标题：OPPO lancia nuove funzioni AI per ColorOS: al via su Find X9 Ultra\n\n网页链接：https://www.oppohub.it/oppo-lancia-nuove-funzioni-ai-per-coloros-al-via-su-find-x9-ultra/\n\n发布时间：2026-04-17T13:45:57+08:00\n\n网页内容：![](https://www.oppohub.it/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/AI-Bill-Manager-1170x780.jpg)\nNews\nOPPO lancia nuove funzioni AI per ColorOS: al via su Find X9 Ultra\na cura di Michele Ingelido 17 Aprile 2026\nGli smartphone non sono solo hardware e questo OPPO lo sa bene. In concomitanza con il lancio di Find X9 Ultra, in uscita in Italia il 21 aprile. la Green Factory ha annunciato anche delle nuove funzionalità esclusive di ColorOS 16, tutte basate sull’intelligenza artificiale. Queste funzioni saranno almeno inizialmente un’esclusiva per Find X9 Ultra, ma prevediamo una graduale espansione anche agli altri smartphone.\nUna delle novità introdotte da ColorOS 16 si chiama AI Bill Manager, ossia una funzionalità che è in grado di estrarre e registrare dettagli sulle spese dalle fatture e dalle bollette. Grazie a questo tipo di analisi, l’utente potrà avere a disposizione una dashboard automatizzata con tutte le proprie spese in un unico luogo.\nLa funzione sarà attivabile dall’AI Mind Space accessibile dal pulsante dedicato o tramite uno swipe a 3 dita dopo un pagamento effettuato dallo smartphone. Funziona sia con i documenti di pagamento fisico che con le transazioni digitali: nel caso di quelle fisiche, sarà necessario aprire la fotocamera, attivare il Mind Space con la stessa gesture e inquadrare la ricevuta di acquisto. Una schermata di nome Bill Memory verrà creata proprio nel Mind Space con tutte le varie spese.\nUn’altra funzionalità inedita di ColorOS 16 è AI Mind Pilot: un’intelligenza artificiale che utilizza più modelli di linguaggio leader del settore per rispondere alle domande dell’utente sulla base dei contenuti presenti nell’AI Mind Space. Sarà possibile scegliere un modello specifico (es. GPT) o utilizzarne più di uno contemporaneamente per generare risposte in parallelo. Un’ulteriore funzione nuova è AI Menu Translation: una sorta di compagno di ristorante durante i viaggi in grado di tradurre i menu e generare contenuti informativi sui vari piatti, nonché di convertire le valute dei prezzi.\nC’è anche il nuovo AI Email Brief che fornisce riepiloghi delle email ogni mattina, includendo la posta delle ultime 24 ore e categorizzando messaggi e cose da fare, nonché consentendone l’aggiunta al calendario con un solo tocco. ColorOS 16 ha altresì introdotto un nuovo Live Space che consente di passare tra notifiche tradizionali a una vista a capsula tramite una gesture, per consentire la vista degli aggiornamenti senza affollare la schermata di blocco. Infine, OPPO sta lavorando insieme a Google per aggiungere il supporto ad AirDrop su Find X9 Ultra.\n\n\n========\n搜索关键词：Color OS 有灵魂的Agent 操作系统\n\n网页标题：OPPO发布ColorOS 16，AI新战略同步推出\n\n网页链接：https://www.nfnews.com/content/Y3MpN15Ay1.html\n\n发布时间：2025-10-16T11:17:00+08:00\n\n网页内容：OPPO发布ColorOS 16，AI新战略同步推出\n作者 葛政涵\n2025-10-16 11:17\n\n![](https://media.nfnews.com/nfplus/ossfs/pic/xy/202510/16/cb742b4f-a81c-4cc4-9259-efb64109696a.jpg)\n10月15日，2025 OPPO开发者大会（ODC25）在深圳举行，OPPO正式发布全新操作系统ColorOS 16。\n“全新ColorOS 16将继续聚焦真实用户场景，用扎实的技术突破，切实解决用户痛点，帮助每个用户成为自己生活的主角。”OPPO ColorOS设计总监陈希说。\n据介绍，ColorOS 16融合了全新的极光引擎、潮汐引擎和自研繁星编译器，分别对应探索感官上限、突破性能极限和提高流畅底限。\n其中全新极光引擎也是安卓首个无缝架构，将不同业务模块进行一体化无缝绘制，以及分布式响应调度，实现全场景的丝滑流畅。潮汐引擎带来了行业首发芯片级动态追帧技术，实现软硬协同的系统级动画性能优化。繁星编译器通过构建从Java到专属硬件的完整编译链，打通上层与底层的编译能力，旨在让大众机型也获得‘顶级流畅’体验，有效解决低算力芯片效能不足的问题。\n在AI功能方面，AI一键闪记在ColorOS 16上迎来重大升级，可以实现长图文中文字信息和图片的有效提取和保存。也能快速解析长视频内容，总结提炼信息生成结构清晰的AI章节摘要，还能实现覆盖日常场景的全方位记录，既能将脑海中随时闪现的灵感以语音交互方式进行记录和内容整理。此外还能一键闪记点餐码、根据账单一键记账。\n\n![](https://media.nfnews.com/nfplus/ossfs/pic/xy/202510/16/1a391451-0e64-4c55-9e08-1c197cef1217.jpg)\nColorOS 16还将小布记忆进行全系统打通，实现包括记忆搜索、记忆问答、记忆推荐在内的智能周到服务，小布助手通过每次对话，不断理解和构建用户个人的AI印象，提供千人千面的个性化问答。另外在AI录音摘要、AI写作支持、AI人像补光等方面也有新的体验。\n开发者大会期间，OPPO AI“新计算、新感知、新生态”的全新战略也正式公布，该战略以On-Device Compute端侧智能计算、PersonaX记忆共生引擎以及Agent Matrix智能体生态框架为三大技术底座，旨在打造与用户共生的智慧系统，引领个人化AIOS。\n在当天下午进行的AI峰会环节，OPPO ColorOS 智能助理部总经理万玉龙表示，OPPO对AIOS的发展方向非常明确。首先是“越用越懂你”，其次是让人机交互逐步告别APP时代，终极形态则是成为“无处不在”且“懂你尊重你”的伙伴，成为用户在数字世界的延伸。\n“流畅是ColorOS的本色，AI将会让ColorOS更加出色。”OPPO软件工程事业部总裁唐凯表示，ColorOS已正式进入AIOS时代，基于新计算、新感知、新生态的OPPO AI全新技术架构，ColorOS16将为用户带来更多、更有想象力的AI新体验。未来，OPPO也将继续做好AI手机的引领者与普及者，更加踏实地让AI更快走进千家万户。\n\n![](https://media.nfnews.com/nfplus/ossfs/pic/xy/202510/16/c7b49144-789d-439b-9a76-db25d9514cec.jpg)\n据悉，全新ColorOS 16将在10月15日开启内测，并将率先搭载在即将上市的OPPO Find X9系列、OPPO Pad 5、一加15以及一加Ace 6等新机型，其他OPPO旗下符合升级新系统要求的机型将从10月30日起陆续推送。\n南方+记者 葛政涵\n编辑 程鹏\n\n\n--------\n搜索关键词：Color OS 有灵魂的Agent 操作系统\n\n网页标题：ColorOS 16 流畅本色, AI 出色\n\n网页链接：https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16\n\n网页内容：更多记录方式与内容类型，记码记账记视频，\nAI 一键闪记啥都能记。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page3_img3-BkUgJkB3.webp)\n随口记\n灵感、待办动动嘴轻松记\n灵感转瞬即逝，琐事转头就忘？只需长按就能触发一键闪记的全新语音交互，直接用语音将脑海中的灵感想法、日程待办记录下来，告别繁琐手动输入，\n就是这么优雅。\n有记忆的小布\n自然更懂你^{8}\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page15_img-BJSFAJIP.webp)\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page15_img1-DB6xEMVA.webp)\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page7_img1-DZQn12JM.webp)\nAI 简报\n专属你的每日头条\n小布还能基于你的个人信息和喜好，每天早晨为你推送一条专属的“头条”。你所关心的天气情况、待办事项、新闻资讯等，一日要闻一播便知。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page8_img1-BI1hMqej.webp)\n记忆...\n个性化服务一步直达^{9}\n小布建议打通记忆，记忆推荐更精准。\n同时上新海量服务卡片，覆盖更多场景，通勤出行、\n电影演出、排队进展等，都能通过多模态全局感知，\n贴心的建议与个性化推荐，服务你的生活方方面面。\nAI 实景对话\n私人向导，指哪答哪\n一键问屏从手机屏幕走进现实，逛街探店、看展答疑一问便知，可连续对话、随时打断，同时支持声纹识别，嘈杂环境中也能听清你的指令。不想开口，\n指一指也能问，指哪答哪。\nAI 影像 再进化\n创作更得心应手\n自带反光板\n找回气血感\n告别阴阳脸、逆光暗脸等拍照困境，AI 智能调配闪光灯、自然光、影棚光等多种光效，一键提升质感秒变大片。无论是氛围感撕拉片还是影棚写真，各种风格轻松拿捏。\n轻松出片更自由^{10}\n相册全面焕新，新增人宠合影图集，留住与毛孩子的珍贵回忆；视频编辑体验大升级，新增变速、转场、配乐等多项能力。还有全新实况拼图、慢动作玩法，让你轻松出片。\nAI 生产力\n高效学习，轻松办公\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page12_img1-mFESWttC.webp)\n全新录音支持 AI 人声增强，让人声更加清晰突出。录音结束后还能自动生成标题，并提供多种格式的 AI 摘要模板，让会议纪要和访谈整理事半功倍。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page12_img2-BToM1NkU.webp)\n写文案、写点评、写回复，都有 AI 为你写作。全新自由写轻松搞定工作总结、演讲稿件等长文，还可以根据内容一键生成 PPT、Excel 表格、思维导图，真正的生产力神器。\n全新便签升级了模块化编辑能力，标题、文本、图片右划一下就能变成独立模块，上下拖拽即可移动顺序，还可以批量编辑格式。在大屏上，手写能力有了 AI 加持，支持手写美化、手写转文本，手写计算器，手写内容也能 AI 搜索一键直达。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page12_img4-CGMGZEQz.webp)\n待办现已迁移至日历应用，AI 能自动识别你所记忆的日程与待办，并生成事项建议卡，还能将当天的日程以时间轴的方式呈现，大事小事清晰掌控。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_topTitle-C1WNKbSU.webp)\n全新光场设计\n焕然一新\n真实有质\n将极具生命力的自然光融入到系统的设计元素中，以光边、渐变模糊、光晕效果诠释真实细腻质感，呈现真实、沉浸、自然之美。\n光场动效\n熠熠生辉\n在动画上，基于极光引擎模拟自然光的变化，融入粒子特效、辉光特效、涟漪特效、色散混色等高阶视觉效果，每一次点按都会带来更沉浸、更生动的动态体验。\nAI 灵感主题\n让你的本色更出色\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page3_img1-BEODU0wp.webp)\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page3_img2-D8rY_4Qo.webp)\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page3_img3-CRvbXG7C.webp)\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page3_img4-DKBWs4gn.webp)\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page3_img5-D5lq7xFj.webp)\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page3_img6-BQBYms4v.webp)\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page3_img7-BFq4Y45g.webp)\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page3_img8-BjQeVLX6.webp)\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page3_img9-C7GaWrMW.webp)\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/page4_bg-CGfyaady.webp)\nAI 实况壁纸\n静态壁纸动起来\n跃然屏上 ^{13}\n有了 AI 实况壁纸，让静态壁纸图片也能“鲜活”起来。\n你可以将喜欢的风景、宠物、动漫图片转化为多种风格的实况壁纸，每一次亮屏都趣味十足。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page5_img1-prEh4EzU.webp)\n壁纸专属文案\n一键 AI 生成\n你还可以为你喜欢的壁纸一键 AI 生成专属文案，\n让每一张壁纸更有故事感。\n可大可小\n随你自由形变^{14}\n无论是桌面图标、卡片还是文件夹，都支持自由拖拽变化大小。你还可以在大图标上添加不同的快捷功能，\n随心装扮你的桌面。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page8_img1-DaIrvKJ0.webp)\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page8_img2-mEgMoFZf.webp)\n灵感图标\nAI 自动取色\n随你自定义\n智能识别壁纸色调，自动为图标取色换装，把桌面变成你的专属调色盘，让整体桌面视觉高度和谐，\n高级感拉满。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_title_text-DMtk7i-9.webp)\n更好的跨生态体验\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page1_image_experience-B29m4fhf.webp)\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page2_img1-BAXbsDI8.webp)\n一碰互传\n分享更自由\n还能传更多^{15}\nOPPO 与 OPPO 支持分享更多内容，如相册、文档、便签、电话本以及部分第三方应用的内容，都可以一碰快速分享。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page3_img1-CpitPreJ.webp)\n流体云、运动数据无缝流转^{16}\nApple Watch 可以接听手机来电、回复短信，还能查看外卖等流体云实时服务信息。 Apple Watch 上的运动记录等数据也能在手机上查看。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros16/assets/mob_page3_img2-CB_56kZV.webp)\n用你的电脑操作你的手机^{17}\n在与 Mac 、Windows 建立连接之后，就可以将手机屏幕镜像投屏到 Mac 上，支持同开 5 个应用窗口，还可以用 Mac 快捷键操作；同时手机收到的应用通知，也会无缝流转到 Mac 上。\n浮窗分身^{18}\n新增浮窗分身功能，应用全屏显示时，在侧边栏中点击同一应用的图标，应用可以浮窗形式打开新页面。\n一个应用，两个任务，并行操作，效率大增。\n智能侧边栏\n优化智能侧边栏界面设计，支持单列或双列显示。\n支持自由编辑，让你的控制中心更具个性化。拖动开关图标调整位置时动态挤位；音频播放器/亮度条/音量条/设备空间等开关支持移除、添加、拖动换位。\n小布识屏\n优化小布识屏全局界面和动效，双指长按或长按导航条即可触发，还有更丰富的 AI 服务可一键直达，\n更美观、更稳定、更流畅。\n新增手机与智慧车载语音助手融合服务，无论唤醒手机端还是车机端的小布助手，都可以操控手机和车机，两个语音助手协同互助，互相联通。\nPC 级 WPS^{20}\n新增 WPS Office PC 版，提供电脑级的文档处理能力，搭配键盘使用，大幅提升办公效率。\n无论是通话、会议、视频等音频，还是文章、报告等文本，都可唤起 AI 摘要为你全程总结。内置多种摘要模版，智能匹配场景，摘要更专业。\nColorOS 16 升级计划\nColorOS 16 正式版\n升级适配计划\n已开启正式版升级机型\nOPPO Find N5\nOPPO Find N5 卫星通信版\nOPPO Find N3\nOPPO Find N3 典藏版\nOPPO Find N3 Flip\nOPPO Find N2\nOPPO Find N2 Flip\nOPPO Find X8 Ultra\nOPPO Find X8 Ultra 卫星通信版\nOPPO Find X8 Pro\n\n\n--------\n搜索关键词：Color OS 有灵魂的Agent 操作系统\n\n网页标题：ColorOS 15 超流畅, 更 AI\n\n网页链接：https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/\n\n网页内容：ColorOS 15\n超流畅, 更 AI\nColorOS 15 体验全面焕新。轻快流畅新体验，每一次操控尽享丝滑。AI 再进化，实用好用，激发无限创造可能。全新设计，见自然，亦见自我。自然光影诠释质感，个性多元尽兴表达。更有海量细节体验提升，越用越好用。\n前所未有的丝滑动效\n就在你的指尖\n行业首发并行动画\n操作再快也能丝滑流畅\n实现多窗口同时运行，响应迅速的同时画面也能丝滑连贯，随着你的指尖一点一滑极速响应，尽情操作。\n每个细节\n都值得细品\n我们把细腻动效带到了系统各方面，不管是自研还是三方应用都能获得一致、舒适的滑动体验，每一划都值得你细细品味。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_1-T7uinOlF.webp)\n稳定高能的极致性能\n怎么玩都尽兴\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_2-BYUxVAYl.webp)\n一边游戏一边视频通话\n全程高帧畅玩\n秒加载、瞬启动\n应用运行畅快自如\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_3-1A0oVf1P.webp)\n流畅双引擎\n释放无限潜能\n极光引擎\n系统级渲染与绘制架构\n重构安卓绘制架构，将传统串行响应架构改为并行响应架构，将多个绘制任务进行合并，统一获取资源，即便上一个动画还未结束，也能做到点击极速响应的同时画面丝滑连贯。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_4-BMJ4ml3G.webp)\n潮汐引擎\n芯片级性能解决方案\n深入到芯片底层实现动态缓存分配，对安卓底层软件算法进行全栈重构，实现更高效的指令加速能力，算法效率提升了 3 倍。不仅带来更极致的性能释放，在多媒体、文件解压缩等不同用户场景均有带来更流畅的体验。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_5-CpSQ9GAc.webp)\n「小布记忆」4\nAI 一键闪记\n记事毫不费力\n通过「快捷键」即可「AI 一键闪记」，AI 快速识别、分析、记录当前屏幕内的各种信息，并存储在「小布记忆」中，需要时还能唤醒小布，一键搜索，快速调用。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/1_c-D8eCouf6.webp)\n跨应用、全场景\n一键啥都能记\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/2_c-Cjo69RaE.webp)\n智能合集\n一站式记忆管理\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/3_c-DSelW5Xa.webp)\n专属记忆\n快速查找\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/4_c-CgpxfroT.webp)\n小布助手5\n系统级交互革新\n一键问屏，问啥都行\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_1-Be5I7iK9.png)\n识屏问答\n刷帖子、刷新闻\n都能一键识屏问答\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_2-Clyt6wxd.webp)\n一圈即问\n感兴趣的内容\n圈一下就有答案\n拍照问答\n你身边的百科全书\n万物皆可一拍全知\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_3-CaEHV9KH.webp)\n有事交给小布\n操作一句话搞定^{6}\n小布可以执行众多应用的常用操作，无论是打车到目的地，还是打开应用搜索商品，你都可以一句话让小布帮你完成。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_17-DN6AMTKT.webp)\n小布胶囊常驻\n一拖即问\n长按文本、图片、文档拖拽至屏幕下方的小布胶囊即可快捷发送至小布，小布为你快速解析内容。分析图片、总结文档，一拖一问就有答案。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_16-CQhljdcP.webp)\n小布和 DeepSeek\n强强联手\n小布助手一键问屏满血融合 DeepSeek，支持联网搜索深度识图解尽难题，OPPO 专属服务器部署流畅问答，并支持导出本地文件。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/5_c-3GC6Iagj.webp)\n跟着 AI 搭子打开思路\n爽了\n英语陪练、求职面试、旅游攻略、美食点评等等，你都可以找 AI 搭子来帮忙，越聊越有趣。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_4-D4jlopmd.webp)\nAI 意图搜索\n一问就有结果 7\n找文件、找截图、找行程\n问问就有\n通过小布助手或全局搜索快速查找设备中的文件、照片、笔记、日程等内容，无需关键词，随口一问就能找到。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_18-3w6wlVRY.webp)\n细节信息\n也能一问便知\nAI 搜索还能更近一步，你可以针对细节信息进行询问和搜索，如入住的酒店地址、飞机起飞时间等，都能精准找到相关内容。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_19-DGttwoY0.webp)\nAI 图像助手\n给你的照片变个魔法\nAI 灵感成片\n拍照无负担\n废片轻松修\nAI 不仅能帮你一键自动构图，智能推荐滤镜。还能还原画面黄金比例，告别拍照“怪角度”，让你一键出片。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_5-D3WxClja.webp)\nAI 超清像素\n放大，再放大\n怎么裁都高清\n你可以对照片任意放大、裁切都不会糊，每一个细节都清晰可见。\nAI 去拖影\n轻点一下\n照片中的拖影轻松去除\n不管是人像还是宠物，AI 去拖影都可以将拍糊的主体清晰还原，呈现真实的光影、色彩和五官细节。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_6-BP7k78NE.webp)\nAI 去反光\n给照片去反光\n就像没有玻璃一样\nAI 还能突破环境的限制，照片中的玻璃反光都能轻松去除，隔窗拍也能如临其境。\nAI 办公助手\n效率起飞\nAI 语音摘记\n重要信息\n帮你一键快速摘要\n无论是音视频通话还是会议，都能一键摘要重点信息，让沟通更高效。\nAI 文档\n全新OPPO文档\n文件处理随手搞定\n一站式文档管理，支持文件随心开、免费转格式、免费翻译，还能秒读文档一键摘要。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_11-v9bmm9NG.webp)\n文档摘要 格式转换 文档翻译\nAI 便签\n记录的灵感瞬间\n接力创作更自由\n不仅可以将记录的灵感一键自动排版，还能进行续写、润色，让文案创作更轻松。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_14-CAugFPS9.webp)\nAI 帮写\n11\n看图生文\n信手拈来\nAI帮写可以读懂照片的内容，帮你生成各式风格的配图文案，还能自动加上表情、打上话题。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_15-BmaPDFT5.webp)\nAI 翻译\n12\n多种招式\n为你随时翻译\n全新翻译 APP 集齐了拍照翻译、对话翻译、同声传译等多种技能，还有可全局唤起的屏幕翻译和实时字幕，让你时刻沟通无忧。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_20-DIfsTLgL.webp)\n安全隐私至关重要\n你的数据只属于你\nAI 私密计算云\n通过硬件级 TEE 可信计算技术，你的隐私数据会在本地安全环境中使用及计算，以保障你的数据安全。我们也将硬件级 TEE 可信计算技术运用在云上计算中，即使在处理更复杂的需求时，也能妥善保障你的隐私。\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_9-CJegOMZ5.webp)\n业界权威隐私保护实力认证\n\n![](https://www.coloros.com/version/coloros15/assets/mobile_pic_10-Di7o0xb_.webp)\n见自然\n全新图标\n映射真实\n虚实有质\n自然光影诠释质感，全新桌面图标以最自然舒适的比例和图形色彩进行重塑，让整体的视觉体验更加真实和自然。\n空间层次\nColorOS 15 正式版\n5. 超级小布助手能力因软件和硬件技术优化、网络环境、个人使用习惯等因素不同，实际体验效果会随不同场景动态变化，请以实际体验为准。\n6. 小布指令自动化执行支持的应用范围与能力请以实际体验为准。\n7. AI 意图搜索可通过小布助手、全局搜索以及文档、相册、便签应用内搜索框调用，需将手机升级至最新软件版本系统，请以实际版本功能及界面为准。\n8. AI 灵感成片能力因软件和硬件技术优化、网络环境、个人使用习惯等因素不同，实际...\n9. AI 语音摘记支持应用范围请以实际体验为准。\n\n--------\n搜索关键词：Color OS 有灵魂的Agent 操作系统\n\n网页标题：2025 OPPO开发者大会发布ColorOS 16，AI新战略能否让手机“懂你”?-太平洋科技\n\n网页链接：https://g.pconline.com.cn/x/2001/20017652.html\n\n发布时间：2025-10-22T12:02:19+08:00\n\n网页内容：2025 OPPO开发者大会发布ColorOS 16，AI新战略能否让手机“懂你”？\n小智\n2025-10-22 12:02:19\n由华为云驱动\n近日，2025 OPPO开发者大会（ODC25）在深圳开幕，发布全新ColorOS 16。OPPO软件工程事业部总裁称其进入AIOS时代。它有全新流畅技术架构、光场设计，打通跨端生态隔阂。OPPO公布AI新战略，赋能下AI应用创新爆发，如AI一键闪记、小布记忆全面进化，将带来更多AI新体验。\n近日，2025 OPPO开发者大会（ODC25）在深圳正式开幕。大会发布了全新ColorOS 16，聚焦OPPO AI的全新战略布局与技术成果，表达了OPPO打造与用户共生的智慧系统，引领个人化AIOS的战略构想。同时，OPPO将全面赋能个人开发者，为生态发展注入创新动力。\nOPPO软件工程事业部总裁表示：“流畅是ColorOS的本色，AI将会让ColorOS更加出色。ColorOS已正式进入AIOS时代，基于新计算、新感知、新生态的OPPO AI全新技术架构，ColorOS 16将为用户带来更多、更有想象力的AI新体验。未来，OPPO也将继续做好AI手机的引领者与普及者，让AI更快地走进千家万户。”\n去年，ColorOS 15凭借流畅双引擎带来极致丝滑的操控体验，获得众多用户好评，被称为“机圈德芙”。今年，全新ColorOS 16对流畅的探索更进一步，带来全新流畅技术架构。\n全新极光引擎，探索感官上限\n全新潮汐引擎，突破性能极限\n还有全新自研的繁星编译器，提高流畅底限\n基于这三大流畅科技，ColorOS将实现全面流畅。\n全新极光引擎带来安卓首个无缝架构，重塑传统安卓模块化架构，将不同业务模块进行一体化无缝绘制和分布式响应调度，实现全场景的丝滑流畅。ColorOS 16还将无缝动画引入系统交互以及三方应用，实现桌面图标无缝拖拽、相册便签无缝缩放位移，三方应用也有“从哪来、到哪去”的无缝丝滑体验。\n针对极限重载场景，全面升级的潮汐引擎带来行业首发芯片级动态追帧技术，实现了软硬协同的系统级动画性能优化。不仅让系统重载流畅度提升37%，功耗更是降低了13%。此外，全新潮汐引擎还提供6年持久流畅的技术承诺，带来重载、久用双重流畅。\nColorOS 16带来全新繁星编译器，基于首个自研安卓跨级融合编译技术，从0到1构建了从Java到专属硬件的完整编译链，让大众机型也有顶级流畅。为解决低算力芯片效能不足的问题，ColorOS 16打通上层与底层的编译能力，真正实现了跨级融合编译的技术突破，大大提升低算力机型的编译效率，充分释放芯片性能。在繁星编译器的加持下，ColorOS 16全面提高了行业千元机的流畅底限，让旗舰流畅成为大众标配。\n在设计方面，ColorOS 16带来全新光场设计，打造更真实、自然、舒适的视觉体验。全新的AI灵感主题融合实况壁纸能力，生动记录人生发光时刻。全新的AI实况壁纸和AI灵感文案，不仅能将静态图转换为更具生命力的动图，还能自动识别匹配符合情绪的文案，充分尊重每个用户的个性表达需求。\n围绕跨端互联体验，ColorOS 16全面打通品牌间的生态隔阂，不仅实现在OPPO手机上接听iPhone电话、短信以及应用通知，更支持AirPods开盖即连、原生降噪以及空间音频等原生体验。电脑端的跨屏互联也迎来升级，用户可以将手机屏幕镜像投屏到电脑，鼠标拖拽即可完成文件传输。OPPO自有生态的一碰互传现在也支持小红书笔记、三方歌单、淘宝链接、视频链接等内容的一碰共享，玩法更多。\nOPPO作为AI手机的引领者与普及者，始终致力于通过AI手机这一载体，以大模型计算能力为中心，全面重塑人与服务的关系。在此次开发者大会上，OPPO AI的全新战略正式公布，即“新计算、新感知、新生态”，以On - Device Compute端侧智能计算、PersonaX记忆共生引擎，以及Agent Matrix智能体生态框架三大技术底座，OPPO AI将打造与用户共生的智慧系统，引领个人化AIOS。\nOn - Device Compute是端侧智能计算的技术底座，通过高密度端侧模型和高性能推理框架，成功突破多模态大模型在移动终端上的应用难题，推理性能峰值能达300tokens/s、128k最长上下文，将端侧智能计算留在掌心，让时刻在线的AI更安全。\nPersonaX作为一个以用户为中心的多模态记忆引擎，依托泛在感知系统，实现对用户全时、全域、全维度行为的深度感知和理解，进而构建起终身记忆驱动的“懂你AI”核心能力。\nAgent Matrix智能体生态框架，是智能体跨设备协同的核心平台，也是AI智能体实现从单步执行升级到复杂任务规划与多设备联动的关键突破，能够为用户带来无缝、高效、智能化的全新交互体验。\n在OPPO AI新战略的赋能下，AI应用创新全面爆发。备受好评的AI一键闪记在ColorOS 16上不仅能够提供记图文、记视频，还能记取餐码、记账目，全新进化的AI一键闪记真正让“记忆”成为AI的标配。全面进化的小布记忆实现了用户形象的全面理解与构建，提供千人千面的个性化服务。同时，ColorOS 16还将小布记忆进行全系统、全链路的一站式全面打通，记忆搜索、记忆问答、记忆推荐的一站式智能周到服务，将带来领先的AI服务体验。\n\n\n--------\n搜索关键词：Color OS 有灵魂的Agent 操作系统\n\n网页标题：OPPO新系统AI战略全开!芯片级破解高温卡顿，AI会记忆能指物，首次打通苹果手表|一加|一加 15|OPPO Find X9|OPPO Find X8|OPPO AI_手机新浪网\n\n网页链接：https://news.sina.cn/ai/2025-10-15/detail-inftymnh3493121.d.html\n\n发布时间：2025-10-15T00:00:00+08:00\n\n网页内容：智东西10月15日报道，今日，OPPO在2025年开发者大会上带来了全新一代操作系统ColorOS 16，并首次系统性公布其AI战略。\n他给出的答案是——流畅，而且必须是流畅。\n基于这一理念，ColorOS 16围绕“流畅、设计、协同与AI能力”四大核心维度展开全面升级：\n1、流畅体验方面 ，搭载极光引擎、潮汐引擎、繁星编译器三大系统架构，全面覆盖系统、三方App、旗舰与大众机型，力求实现“全场景流畅”。\n2、设计语言方面 ，引入全新“光场”UI设计，结合AI人像补光等能力，进一步提升整体视觉与交互感受。\n3、跨设备协同方面 ，新增Apple Watch互通、PC端AI搜索手机内容 、车机灵感卡片显示等功能，打通多终端智能联动。\n4、AI能力方面 ，系统内置 AI一键闪记、AI取餐码、AI随口记、AI实景对话、AI简报等功能，系统应用也同步升级，强调“本地记忆”与“智能联动”协同发力，打造用户专属的AI助手。\n\n![](https://k.sinaimg.cn/n/spider20251015/711/w1000h511/20251015/f5e9-9106f9748af81493b19fc3e361e0e052.jpg/w700d1q75cms.jpg?by=cms_fixed_width)\n此次ColorOS 16的发布，是向“个人化AI操作系统”进化的关键节点。\n在AI战略层面，OPPO AI的技术架构将围绕三大核心底座展开重构：\n1、On-Device Compute端侧智能计算：本地高性能AI推理模块，峰值推理性能达到300 TOPS/s，并支持最长128K上下文；\n2、PersonaX记忆共生引擎：通过终身记忆与泛在感知技术，持续构建用户的数字画像；\n3、Agent Matrix智能体生态框架：实现跨App、跨设备的个性化智能体服务部署。\n\n![](https://k.sinaimg.cn/n/spider20251015/740/w1000h540/20251015/a5a5-b82586a8c0a7a415ad1ab0a354e56035.jpg/w700d1q75cms.jpg?by=cms_fixed_width)\n唐凯明确谈道，OPPO将以这三大技术底座为支撑，“与用户一起走进AI OS的新时代”。\nOPPO ColorOS设计总监陈希在大会上谈道，ColorOS 16的核心目标是“全面流畅”，不只是桌面动画，而是系统在全场景、全设备、全区域的稳定一致性表现。\n为此，ColorOS 16引入三大引擎分别解决不同层次的流畅问题。首先，极光引擎重构了安卓动效架构，带来安卓首个一体化“无缝”架构，将搜索、负一屏、抽屉等系统界面动效逻辑统一，配合“从哪里来、回哪里去”的视觉机制，解决过去安卓多模块割裂问题。\n\n![](https://k.sinaimg.cn/n/spider20251015/51/w1000h651/20251015/16d7-0fc2d9f3141a11dc7661661ee6c0057f.jpg/w700d1q75cms.jpg?by=cms_fixed_width)\n其次，潮汐引擎则是行业首发将动态追踪下沉至芯片底层的技术，通过更精细的功耗分配，在高温、高负载等极限场景中保持系统稳定性。第三，全新推出的繁星编译器，面向大众机型自研跨级融合编译链，大幅提升中低端芯片设备在启动、滑动与响应等维度的基础流畅性。\n\n![](https://k.sinaimg.cn/n/spider20251015/15/w1000h615/20251015/c5b2-b50e35187228c3cd1e86bc3495ce2811.jpg/w700d1q75cms.jpg?by=cms_fixed_width)\n二、“一键闪记”全面升级，AI取餐码、自动记账主打“实用”\n在ColorOS 16中，OPPO将AI能力落地的重点，聚焦在打造具备记忆能力的系统级功能——一键闪记。这一功能已不再局限于文本，而是逐步构建起一套贯穿“视觉理解、多模态输入、上下文记忆”的全方位能力。\n陈希提到，AI推荐与附加功能的成立依赖于“记忆”能力，这是支撑智能系统运行的首要前提。ColorOS 16则持续加码记忆相关能力，推出“记多图”“记视频”“随口记”“AI取餐码”“自动记账”等功能，覆盖用户生活中的多个关键场景。\n在日常系统建议层面，小布建议也迎来升级，新增“AI简报”功能，基于用户个人信息和偏好，在早晨...\n\n![](https://k.sinaimg.cn/n/spider20251015/798/w1000h598/20251015/2a4b-0655f2e8eed5f2bee62aaccf66b4ad7e.jpg/w700d1q75cms.jpg?by=cms_fixed_width)\n三、小布实景对话走出屏幕，系统应用全面AI化升级\nColorOS 16中，小布助手迎来一次标志性升级，其核心功能“AI实景对话”首次让助手“走出屏幕”，进入现实场景进行交互。陈希在发布会上谈道，这项功能最初灵感来源用户在美术馆使用AI查询展品信息时的反馈：由于环境嘈杂，语音助手常被误识别，无法顺畅交流，只能手动打字，极大影响体验。\n为此，ColorOS 16引入了专属声纹识别技术，可在博物馆、美术馆、商场等高噪音场景中精准识别用户声音，实现稳定的个性化对话体验。陈希称：“环境再嘈杂，它也能专注与你对话。”\n更进一步，小布新增了“指物识别”能力，支持 跨屏幕、跨空间的实景理解 。用户只需手指所指，小布便可识别并理解用户关注的展品或实物，提供实时讲解与知识问答，真正实现“穿越手机屏幕”的空间交互。陈希称：“不光可以点屏幕，穿过屏幕，在屏幕外指一下也可以。”\n此外，小布助手还支持连续实时的视频对话，用户无需频繁拍照上传，即可实现如“私人讲解员”般的自然问答，打破传统交互碎片化的限制。\n在线下门店场景中，OPPO还与大众点评达成深度合作，支持用户在逛街或探店时，通过实景对话功能调用手机中大众点评的店铺信息与菜单数据，完成类似“AI版探店助手”的体验。即使站在餐厅门口，也无需手动搜索，AI即可提供评价、推荐菜品与价格信息。\nOPPO展示了ColorOS 16在跨设备协同方面的新进展。\n在跨设备协同方面，ColorOS 16展示了更完整的多端连接能力。它首次实现与Apple Watch生态的打通，能够在手表上直接呈现流体卡片并同步通知内容。\n平板系统也进行了大幅重构，桌面布局更贴合大屏交互逻辑，WPS应用原生适配上线，手写笔功能支持实时书写美化与公式识别。\n\n![](https://k.sinaimg.cn/n/spider20251015/775/w1000h575/20251015/f369-64e2ef0769e9860c73a28ec63d768d47.jpg/w700d1q75cms.jpg?by=cms_fixed_width)\n此外，PC端新增AI搜索手机内容的能力，用户可以直接在平板上检索或迁移备忘录，实现信息的无缝衔接。同时，一碰互传功能得到扩展，除了文件外，还支持红包、小红书链接等内容的跨设备分享。\n车机系统则成为ColorOS生态的又一支点，已接入超过180个汽车品牌，可在中控屏上展示灵感主题与服务卡片，实现车端与手机端的同步体验。\nColorOS 16将于10月15日起向审核通过用户推送，10月30日面向全量用户推送，OPPO Find X9系列、一加15、OPPO Pad 5为首批搭载机型。\n唐凯在发言中谈道，ColorOS的战略路径已从“AI for System”迈入“System for AI”，正向“AI as System”阶段推进。\nAI不再是系统中的一项功能，而是整个系统的运行机制与能力分配核心。从版本节奏、功能构成、技术栈到底层结构，ColorOS 16正在将AI从工具变为操作系统本体，开启AI原生系统的新路径。\n\n"}